# One CI gate, one file (issue #991).
ci_gate check-required-documentation
  stage web
  description "Required public documents exist and retain the level-two sections declared in data/meta/required-documentation.json."
  run "node scripts/check-required-documentation.mjs"
  justification "Issue #1580 and Hive Mind CI/CD best practice 12 require documentation files and headings; policy-only and rustdoc checks cannot detect a deleted README or contribution section."
